WEBVTT

00:01:55.919 --> 00:02:00.196
The story of mechanization,
automation and digitization

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:03.402
all point to the role of technology
and its importance.

00:02:04.274 --> 00:02:06.735
Those stories of technological
transformation

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:09.473
make scale seem, well, normal.

00:02:09.497 --> 00:02:10.647
Or expected.

00:02:11.052 --> 00:02:12.393
And stable.

00:02:12.417 --> 00:02:14.483
And sometimes even predictable.

00:02:15.012 --> 00:02:19.035
But it also puts the focus squarely
on technology and technology change.

00:02:19.964 --> 00:02:23.447
But I believe that scaling a technology
and building a system

00:02:23.471 --> 00:02:25.151
requires something more.

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:30.022
We founded the 3Ai Institute
at the Australian National University